kafka-sre-llm builds a retrieval index over the documentation of the projects listed below
(sources.yaml has the exact configuration). The index file (chunks.jsonl, 6,444 chunks; hash
in kafka_sre_rag/frozen.json) contains text taken from these projects. For every source below,
the text was converted to plain text (Markdown, AsciiDoc, reStructuredText, HTML or OpenAPI
YAML to plain text with headings), cleaned (front matter, comments, images, shortcodes,
includes and link markup removed; AsciiDoc attributes expanded) and split into chunks of up to
4,000 characters. No other change was made to the wording. The chunks are not the upstream
documents and are not endorsed by the projects.

Each upstream repository was read at the pinned tag or commit given below. Licence texts are
those of the LICENSE files in the checkouts at those pins.

